  11. W11: settle event, move a settled expense to Ungrouped → coverage leaves; source stays consistent
  12. WF: 1500 random action sequences (add/settle/unmark/move/close/reopen) — invariants hold after EVERY step
  13. RT: 1500 random states — the settle OFFER equals true remaining, and paying it squares the member exactly (never over)
  14. XC: a member in two clubs — each club's balances/simplify are fully independent (no cross-club netting)

